msgstr "以太网交换机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:32
#: 5a3a0a33f71f4e638cd4be117d47e34a
msgid ""
"Since there are more than 2 Ethernet devices in the system, it is truly a "
"network and to provide interconnectivity an Ethernet Switch is used. It "
"forms the \"heart\" of the system. In this case, it's a small BotBlox switch"
" specifically designed for ArduPilot applications with convenient JST_GH "
"1.25mm connectors:"
msgstr ""
"由于系统中以太网设备超过两台，构成了真正的网络，需要以太网交换机提供互联。它是系统的「核心」。在本例中，使用了一款专为 ArduPilot "
"应用设计的小型 BotBlox 交换机，配备方便的 JST-GH 1.25mm 连接器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:38
#: 8a6910ba2ff142a58b8fb9c76e233108
msgid ""
"The gimbal, autopilot, and wireless air unit all plug into this and the "
"Ethernet traffic between them is automatically routed."
msgstr "云台、飞控和无线空中单元均插入此交换机，它们之间的以太网流量将自动路由。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:41
#: 591ab76aeaf549b6b2c4e7f2719f1da4
msgid "AutoPilot Basic Setup"
msgstr "飞控基础设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:42
#: 19b39e6e395d406ca922a87640999611
msgid ""
"To enable Ethernet on the autopilot the following parameters are set (other "
"NET params stay at default) and reboot the autopilot"
msgstr "要在飞控上启用以太网，设置以下参数（其他 NET 参数保持默认）并重启飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:44
#: 8f320b9808174fd5a44a6308fbe68053
msgid ":ref:`NET_ENABLE<NET_ENABLE>` = 1"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_ENABLE<NET_ENABLE>` = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:46
#: 8637a8ff65494665955044724415abe2
msgid ""
"then set the autopilot's IP address, it must be in the 192.168.144.x to be "
"in the Herelink's listening range..this will drive other addresses to be set"
" later also:"
msgstr ""
"然后设置飞控的 IP 地址，必须在 192.168.144.x 范围内才能在 Herelink 的监听范围内……这也决定了后续其他地址的设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:48
#: 9aa3828bf9c948b892613805c6f9c2e8
msgid ":ref:`NET_IPADDR0<NET_IPADDR0>` = 192"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_IPADDR0<NET_IPADDR0>` = 192"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:49
#: 161bdcd022c74454801c8b61bdf7a826
msgid ":ref:`NET_IPADDR1<NET_IPADDR1>` = 168"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_IPADDR1<NET_IPADDR1>` = 168"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:50
#: da2a3d1fc163486096a166fe147e2356
msgid ":ref:`NET_IPADDR2<NET_IPADDR2>` = 144"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_IPADDR2<NET_IPADDR2>` = 144"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:51
#: de197d8d13d64c60a6a70ff25fcf0907
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_IPADDR3<NET_IPADDR3>` = 26 <- arbitrarily chosen but must not be "
"11 (Herelink fixed address)"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_IPADDR3<NET_IPADDR3>` = 26  <- 随意选定，但不得为 11（Herelink 固定地址）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:52
#: 07a2b4c94d334dfdbf432648ab947c38
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_NETMASK<NET_NETMASK>` = 24 <- this says we are in a subnet with "
"addresses 192.168.144.1 to 192.168.144.254"
msgstr ""
":ref:`NET_NETMASK<NET_NETMASK>` = 24  <- 表示我们位于地址范围为 192.168.144.1 到 "
"192.168.144.254 的子网中"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:54
#: 377e1923c72a42d0bec49320d257da0a
msgid ""
"if the autopilot needs to communicate with IP addresses outside this range "
"it will use a \"gateway\" in the subnet...we wont be doing this but it still"
" needs to be set:"
msgstr "如果飞控需要与该范围之外的 IP 地址通信，将使用子网中的「网关」……本例不需要，但仍需设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:56
#: 989d1c75965f43348720520980597f06
msgid ":ref:`NET_GWADDR0<NET_GWADDR0>` = 192"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_GWADDR0<NET_GWADDR0>` = 192"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:57
