msgstr ":ref:`NET_GWADDR2<NET_GWADDR2>` = 144"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:59
#: ca5f2a06219144d18bccec7a395e1904
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_GWADDR3<NET_GWADDR3>` = 1 <- typical address of subnet gateway"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_GWADDR3<NET_GWADDR3>` = 1  <- 子网网关的典型地址"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:61
#: 65546fa6bbb9476ab16fbada044f6ea8
msgid "Now basic Ethernet for the autopilot is enabled"
msgstr "现在飞控的基础以太网已启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:64
#: f80502ae64bd438ea394543a14378f60
msgid "Gimbal Camera Setup"
msgstr "云台相机设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:65
#: 06a60c6cdad54fb89f4fbfb63140725a
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 4 to allow camera control of shutter, etc."
msgstr "将 :ref:`CAM1_TYPE<CAM1_TYPE>` = 4 以启用相机快门等控制功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:67
#: 44767856a65c472fb7b99426b86ba562
msgid ""
"The gimbal/camera must be set up to use the Ethernet for video streaming and"
" its IP param setup. To do this download the `SIYI Assistant "
"<https://siyi.biz/en/index.php?id=downloads&asd=22>`__ and use it to set the"
" following:"
msgstr ""
"云台/相机必须配置为通过以太网进行视频流传输，并设置其 IP 参数。为此，请下载 `SIYI 助手 "
"<https://siyi.biz/en/index.php?id=downloads&asd=22>`__ 并用它设置以下内容："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:72
#: 2162030e37414e15802a4d2acd9a2fa8
msgid "save and power cycle the gimbal."
msgstr "保存并对云台重新上电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:74
#: 3dc4bf4c69e0493f9305d737f94fa802
msgid ""
"This sets the gimbal's IP address within the Herelink's listening range for "
"passthru to the ground controller to display video and sets its video output"
" to Ethernet with an H.264 encoded stream that the ground station can "
"decode. Now the camera will be streaming video over Ethernet, through the "
"switch, and the Herelink air unit will transmit it down to the ground "
"controller."
msgstr ""
"此设置将云台的 IP 地址设置在 Herelink 监听范围内，以便透传到地面控制器显示视频，并将视频输出设置为通过以太网传输 H.264 "
"编码流供地面站解码。这样相机就会通过以太网经交换机传输视频，Herelink 空中单元将其下传至地面控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:76
#: 4b5a9ee9dc42472bab345f3cbe331e48
msgid ""
"As of this writing, the SIYI A8 camera has about 1 second image latency over"
" Ethernet which makes its use for realtime FPV guidance not viable. I also "
"have a mini HDMI cable attached from the SIYI HDMI port to the Herelink's "
"HDMI1 input and switch the source in the SIYI Assistant to HDMI rather than "
"Ethernet (source = \"Close\") when I actually fly. Other gimbals from SIYI "
"or others may or may not have this issue. Also the Herelink Air Unit uses "
"better bandwidth management if the HDMI input is used. But the setup "
"illustrates the method for use in other device combinations."
msgstr ""
"截至撰写本文时，SIYI A8 相机通过以太网传输的图像延迟约 1 秒，不适合实时 FPV 引导。在实际飞行时，我也会用 Mini HDMI 线缆将 "
"SIYI HDMI 端口连接到 Herelink 的 HDMI1 输入，并在 SIYI 助手中将来源切换为 HDMI "
"而非以太网（来源设为「关闭」）。SIYI 或其他品牌的其他云台可能有或没有此问题。另外，使用 HDMI 输入时 Herelink "
"空中单元的带宽管理也更好。但本设置展示了在其他设备组合中使用的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:79
#: 55f59a876fe64e22b81522f2f4bb30f5
msgid "Gimbal Control"
msgstr "云台控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:81
#: 7b500f7cbddd4026b714248418b260a1
msgid ""
"Control of the gimbal (pan/tilt/camera start/stop,etc.) over Ethernet is "
"obtained from the autopilot which interprets MAVLink commands (also AUX "
"switch inputs) and sends them to the gimbal. First, we must set up ArduPilot"
" to control the Mount/Camera:"
msgstr ""
"通过以太网控制云台（横滚/俯仰/相机开始/停止等）由飞控实现，飞控解释 MAVLink 命令（以及 AUX 开关输入）并将其发送给云台。首先需要设置 "
"ArduPilot 来控制挂载/相机："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:83
#: 8029eac16d4649c0868d0cf76ce52312
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE<MNT1_TYPE>` = 8 This selects the SIYI mount type"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_TYPE<MNT1_TYPE>` = 8  此处选择 SIYI 挂载类型"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:85
#: 385596b8e26640a48e22615fce11a253
msgid "then reboot to see all the MNT params and set:"
msgstr "然后重启以查看所有 MNT 参数并设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:87
#: 330ce1ffd30c4c978fbd5e904c443dae
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX<MNT1_YAW_MAX>` = 135"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MAX<MNT1_YAW_MAX>` = 135"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:88
#: bd2bfe59faf84317a814980f0beae30f
msgid ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN<MNT1_YAW_MIN>` = -135"
msgstr ":ref:`MNT1_YAW_MIN<MNT1_YAW_MIN>` = -135"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:90
#: 7afd1e82099249fd95f9275738ebeb7c
msgid "which is the limit of the yaw that SIYI can accommodate."
msgstr "这是 SIYI 云台偏航轴的角度限制。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:92
#: 047363ba1b8542c3a6987a49b2c84369
msgid ""
"Then we need to set up an Ethernet mechanism to communicate. Using the "
"NET_P1 params we will create a \"virtual\" serial port to talk to the "
"mount/camera, just as if we were using a UART (which the SIYI could also use"
" instead of Ethernet control, but why add wires?). Set:"
msgstr ""
"然后需要设置以太网通信机制。使用 NET_P1 参数，我们将创建一个「虚拟」串口来与挂载/相机通信，就好像使用 UART 一样（SIYI 也可以使用 "
"UART 控制而非以太网，但何必多加线缆？）。设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:94
#: 1e499bd9a3054c0cbb77cd3cd7950bb2
msgid ":ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>` = 1 <- UDP Client type of port"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P1_TYPE<NET_P1_TYPE>` = 1  <- UDP 客户端类型端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:96
#: 474849905ef3492b9e0ea4fb58e3f55e
msgid "reboot for the params to show:"
msgstr "重启以显示相关参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:98
#: de9df093b9124646a39fee621099c6d5
msgid ":ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>` = 192"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P1_IP0<NET_P1_IP0>` = 192"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:99
#: 5e4726dc3b754a7eb1200effcdd71e5f
msgid ":ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>` = 168"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P1_IP1<NET_P1_IP1>` = 168"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:100
#: 1c925f2e662a4318a47bf00b47e30224
msgid ":ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>` = 144"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P1_IP2<NET_P1_IP2>` = 144"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:101
#: 13469bf0cc24438caf7ac0e68508b834
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>` = 25   <- the IP address we set for the Gimbal"
" previously"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P1_IP3<NET_P1_IP3>` = 25  <- 之前为云台设置的 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:102
#: bd757d3cfc4c413a8a1b551082b4d4dd
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>` = 37260 <- this is the port that Gimbal "
"listens for commands"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P1_PORT<NET_P1_PORT>` = 37260  <- 云台监听命令的端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:103
#: 65b6f5f8f41b4d5483dcde8967c9e427
msgid ":ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` = 8 <- Gimbal serial protocol"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P1_PROTOCOL<NET_P1_PROTOCOL>` = 8  <- 云台串口协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:105
#: 68a7517faa894a7abf46eceaf5c4cdf0
msgid ""
"Now gimbal/camera commands from the autopilot (MAVLink or AUX functions "
"translated to SIYI commands) will be sent to the SIYI gimbal"
msgstr "现在来自飞控的云台/相机命令（MAVLink 或已转换为 SIYI 命令的 AUX 功能）将发送到 SIYI 云台"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:108
#: 4320f20076fa4e8ead4080988e05d17c
msgid "Telemetry Setup"
msgstr "数传设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:109
#: 5846c6f55cde4588b61cc8128003b788
msgid ""
"In order to display telemetry and communicate MAVLink commands to/from the "
"GCS app running on the Herelink ground controller, we must set up a MAVLink "
"path from the autopilot to Herelink air unit. We will use another "
"\"virtual\" serial port (NET_P2) on Ethernet to talk from/to the autopilot "
"to/from the Herelink air unit:"
msgstr ""
"为了在 Herelink 地面控制器上运行的地面站应用中显示数传并与之进行 MAVLink 命令通信，需要设置从飞控到 Herelink 空中单元的 "
"MAVLink 路径。将使用另一个「虚拟」串口（NET_P2）通过以太网在飞控与 Herelink 空中单元之间进行通信："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:111
#: fb95bd8716094bdbb60c8c372cfb932e
msgid ":ref:`NET_P2_TYPE<NET_P2_TYPE>` = 1 <-UDP Client"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P2_TYPE<NET_P2_TYPE>` = 1  <- UDP 客户端"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:113
#: ca4e4be2285944e19e72196c19e631ad
msgid "rebooot for the params to show:"
msgstr "重启以显示相关参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:115
#: 56db5797f5b74df68c5c28c1c634697d
msgid ":ref:`NET_P2_IP0<NET_P2_IP0>` = 192"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P2_IP0<NET_P2_IP0>` = 192"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:116
#: 02748a6001ca44a98724d3b0a7d47411
msgid ":ref:`NET_P2_IP1<NET_P2_IP1>` = 168"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P2_IP1<NET_P2_IP1>` = 168"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:117
#: 41240f11321140de8cf797bcde4e7cd5
msgid ":ref:`NET_P2_IP2<NET_P2_IP2>` = 144"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P2_IP2<NET_P2_IP2>` = 144"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:118
#: a47a1e3fc6574bdf986eeb4ecf8afaed
msgid ""
":ref:`NET_P2_IP3<NET_P2_IP3>` = 11 <- this is the IP address of the Herelink"
" air unit"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P2_IP3<NET_P2_IP3>` = 11  <- Herelink 空中单元的 IP 地址"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:119
#: edb0aa51cf0f423e83885765b64b0e26
msgid ":ref:`NET_P2_PORT<NET_P2_PORT>` = 14550 <- on this port"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P2_PORT<NET_P2_PORT>` = 14550  <- 通过此端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:120
#: 7b73ee8759354a4eb8aca3e7e4e6eebc
msgid ":ref:`NET_P2_PROTOCOL<NET_P2_PROTOCOL>` = 2 <- using MAVLink2 protocol"
msgstr ":ref:`NET_P2_PROTOCOL<NET_P2_PROTOCOL>` = 2  <- 使用 MAVLink2 协议"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:122
#: a911e9f14f6c4bf59d85d615ea1a77ba
msgid ""
"now telemetry will be sent to/from the Herelink ground unit. Opening the GCS"
" app on the ground controller should automatically connect to the UDP "
"telemetry stream."
msgstr "现在数传将在 Herelink 地面单元之间收发。在地面控制器上打开地面站应用应能自动连接到 UDP 数传流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:125
