msgid "QGC Video Setup"
msgstr "QGC 视频设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:132
#: a53615e40cc8472f9d653611723b7ae7
msgid ""
"To see the video stream on the Herelink ground controller when using the QGC"
" app, go to Application Settings/Video settings and select the RSTP source "
"and enter this URL: \"**rstp://192.168.144.25:8554/main.264**\" video should"
" now appear in QGC. Likewise, this source can be used in other GCS apps to "
"display the video."
msgstr ""
"在 Herelink 地面控制器上使用 QGC 应用查看视频流时，请进入「应用设置/视频设置」，选择 RTSP 来源并输入以下 "
"URL：「**rtsp://192.168.144.25:8554/main.264**」，视频应随即出现在 QGC "
"中。同样，此来源也可用于其他地面站应用显示视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:135
#: 6fe30dc46c204e9d9c147b3bb908f231
msgid ""
"if you decide to use HDMI (recommended), then leave the setting in QGC at "
"its default setting of \"Autoconnect Video Streams\""
msgstr "如果决定使用 HDMI（推荐），则在 QGC 中保持默认的「自动连接视频流」设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:138
#: 46702536c0614968b410192a24f5402c
msgid "The Tower of Babel: Physical wiring"
msgstr "巴别塔：物理接线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:139
#: c8724698771d49b2bf8547c0a35c814e
msgid ""
"The physical interconnects between the devices is a challenge.  Most device "
"suppliers provide some way to cable out the Ethernet from their device. "
"Unfortunately, this usually involves providing a cable with either a large "
"RJ-45 male or female plug/jack, requiring bulky CAT5 cabling for "
"interconnects. And the device end that uses smaller gauge wires to that "
"RJ-45 termination have non-standarized connectors, sometimes 5 pin, "
"sometimes 4 pin JST-GH."
msgstr ""
"各设备之间的物理互连是一大挑战。大多数设备供应商提供了某种从其设备引出以太网线缆的方式。不幸的是，这通常意味着提供带有大型 RJ-45 "
"公头或母头的线缆，需要使用笨重的 CAT5 线缆进行互连。而设备端连接到该 RJ-45 端头的细线采用非标准化连接器，有时是 5 针，有时是 4 针 "
"JST-GH。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:141
#: 3626a20afdc942c4b3a40147f80f7ca3
msgid ""
"With the aid of something like this BotBlox adapter which has many of the "
"connector that are used wired in parallel, you can usually rig up a bulky "
"set up on the bench for testing:"
msgstr "借助类似这款 BotBlox 适配器（其将许多常用连接器并联），通常可以在工作台上拼凑出一套笨重的测试设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:148
#: 4a7e774c3b214ac99a95be061418fbb1
