" 6\" cables with JST-GH connectors. This can be done by obtaining either the"
" appropriate pre-made cables for each pin count and cutting and soldering "
"them together or making them directly with jst-gh connector kits like this:"
msgstr ""
"但这不适合实际飞行器使用。在本例中，我制作了带有 JST-GH 连接器的约 15cm 短线缆。可以通过购买各针数的适合预制线缆并裁剪焊接，或直接使用 "
"JST-GH 连接器套件制作，例如："

#: ../../source/docs/common-ethernet-vehicle.rst:150
